    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore, craft, build, and fight in this top down adventure RPG!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/347940/extras/a73c11a2a47f85f1f6e80b8f2d19a597.poster.avif?t=1752850640\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/347940/extras/a73c11a2a47f85f1f6e80b8f2d19a597.webm?t=1752850640\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/347940/extras/a73c11a2a47f85f1f6e80b8f2d19a597.mp4?t=1752850640\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>DISCOVER</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore a procedurally generated world, mine resources, discover secrets, find treasures, and travel to distant lands!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/347940/extras/ef2b0c35cfb207bcf375fab5a3ac8575.poster.avif?t=1752850640\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/347940/extras/ef2b0c35cfb207bcf375fab5a3ac8575.webm?t=1752850640\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/347940/extras/ef2b0c35cfb207bcf375fab5a3ac8575.mp4?t=1752850640\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>BUILD</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build your very own home! Gather resources and build in your own way. From wooden shacks, to obsidian brick fortresses. Plant charming gardens or herbs, construct animal pens, create\u00a0extravagant vaults to display your rarest treasures.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/347940/extras/ca6fa32962baf53198693f9b2ddb263e.poster.avif?t=1752850640\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/347940/extras/ca6fa32962baf53198693f9b2ddb263e.webm?t=1752850640\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/347940/extras/ca6fa32962baf53198693f9b2ddb263e.mp4?t=1752850640\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>FIGHT</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Battle a variety of foes and formidable bosses and obtain new powerful equipment!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/347940/extras/ad439cb07df6fcbb765db5fa7d932701.poster.avif?t=1752850640\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/347940/extras/ad439cb07df6fcbb765db5fa7d932701.webm?t=1752850640\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/347940/extras/ad439cb07df6fcbb765db5fa7d932701.mp4?t=1752850640\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Relax</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play at your own pace, and in your own style. Whether it's planting and growing crops, raising farm animals, fishing, crafting, collecting, or helping friendly NPCs you'll meet on your travels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/347940/extras/95f4449be5f4554b5a1d1716e21edd1e.avif?t=1752850640\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>ITEMS</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Over 800+ items to find and collect! Obtained from a wide range of activities, including crafting, gathering, defeating monsters, treasure chests, fishing, and quest rewards!</p>",
